# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AI Copy Assistant (optional)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get a key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey and copy this file to `.env`.
# Without a key, everything else in the app works — the AI panel simply shows
# a configuration message instead of generating copy.
#
# NEVER commit your real .env file (it is gitignored).

# Server-side only. Required for the AI copy assistant.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional — override the Gemini model (defaults to gemini-3.6-flash).
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.6-flash